[[Image:Isk perform.gif|right|Perform]]
A [[bard]] using '''perform''' can perform the [[bard song]], which improves their allies' ability to fight in combat and withstand mind-affecting enemies. Perform is essential for any bard who wants to have access to their bard song.
*'''Ability''': [[charisma]]

*'''Classes''': [[bard]]

*'''[[Cross-class skill|Cross-class]]''': no

*'''[[untrained skill check|Requires training]]''': no

*'''Check''': None required. The higher the [[skill point|rank]] in this skill, the better the bard song.

*'''Use''': Select the skill and it will affect a 30-foot radius of allies around the singer.

==Notes==
*The perform skill also affects the potency of a [[curse song]].
*Despite the "Use" note, the perform skill isn't directly selectable for use. It is applied when a bard uses bard song or curse song.
